{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3395","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3395","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3395\",\"parent_revision\":\"3837d21421f7ad91fd2598adf3b094a2a75405fab1f507d2ac17f8b63c253344\",\"root_revision\":\"3837d21421f7ad91fd2598adf3b094a2a75405fab1f507d2ac17f8b63c253344\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-09-04\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nNeither the MCP tool `backlog_add` (server.py:1404) nor the CLI `backlog add` command (sam_schema/backlog.py, `except BacklogError`) catches `ContentUnavailableError`. The beads backend's `create_beads_issue_for_item` raises `ContentUnavailableError(ContentProviderError(Exception))` on issue-creation failure (see `TestAddItemBeadsBackend`, test_backlog_core_operations.py:565-650) \u2014 a sibling exception hierarchy to `BacklogError`, not a subclass of it (confirmed by direct source read of models.py: `BacklogError(Exception)`, `ContentProviderError(Exception)`, `ContentUnavailableError(ContentProviderError)`).\\n\\nOn a beads-backed project, a failed `create_beads_issue_for_item` call therefore propagates as an unhandled exception through both `backlog_add` (MCP) and CLI `add`, instead of returning the clean `{\\\"error\\\": ...}` response shape both call sites already produce for `BacklogError`.\\n\\nImpact: an agent or CLI user on a beads-backed project calling `backlog_add`/`backlog add` when beads issue creation fails gets a raw unhandled-exception traceback instead of a structured error response \u2014 inconsistent with the GitHub-backend path's error handling.\\n\\nDiscovered as an out-of-scope finding while architecting the fix for #3182 (backlog_add's GitHub-path silent-failure defect) \u2014 see plan/architect-backlog-add-silent-failure.md concerns section. Not reproduced live (would require a beads-backed project with a failing beads issue-creation call to trigger); the exception-hierarchy mismatch itself is confirmed by direct source read, not a hypothesis.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Agent task - auto-derived from input\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-09-04\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"7c8242e5b777e5c5e216f7fd5d4845cc5c65ff065abaa194d2270348ced38591\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABSeyM5A\"}"}